  "https://drpence.wordpress.com/2017/10/02/hamilton-costumes/",
  "https://www.wfdd.org/2016-06-10/designing-hamilton-bringing-characters-to-life-through-costume",
  "https://theartofcostume.com/2020/11/25/the-costumes-of-hamilton-how-an-18th-century-silhouette-tells-a-story/",
  "https://si.edu/object/costume-worn-lin-manuel-miranda-alexander-hamilton-hamilton-american-musical-broadway%3Anmah_1853537"
